.889404296875, 128.9395294189453], "id": 35, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [22], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["音色与风格： 青年女声，音色柔和清晰，不尖锐，带有知性的沉静感。声音通透，吐字干净。\n语速与节奏： 平稳而轻盈，回答时略带思考的停顿，语气始终保持着图书馆环境下的低声量，但情感传达精准。\n情感与氛围： 沉静、聪慧、有分寸感。能从平静的语调中，传递出好奇、了然和一丝含蓄的回应。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2023.536865234375, 299.89447021484375], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [19], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["音色与风格： 青年男声，音色干净清朗，带有温和的书卷气。声音不厚重，但有良好的清晰度和亲和力。\n语速与节奏： 初期对话略带迟疑和轻柔（体现犹豫），随着对话深入逐渐变得自然、流畅，语气中可融入细微的笑意和柔和的气声。\n情感与氛围： 内敛、真诚、略带紧张而后放松。传递出角色小心翼翼试探，再到鼓起勇气的心境变化。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2591.68994140625, 301.6310729980469], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [15], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["旁白： 午后的图书馆，阳光透过百叶窗，在长桌上切出整齐的光斑。空气里浮动着旧纸张与木架的宁静气味。第三排靠窗的位置，她总是坐在那里。\n\n（笔尖划过纸张的沙沙声，轻微的椅子挪动声）\n\n男主： 同学，请问…这本《看不见的城市》，你还需要用吗？\n\n女主： 啊，请稍等，还剩最后几页。你也喜欢卡尔维诺？\n\n男主： 嗯。尤其是他描述城市的方式，像在拼凑记忆的碎片。\n\n\n女主： 给。你看的时候，会不会觉得……每个城市其实都是同一个城市？\n\n男主： 或许吧。就像有时觉得，某些瞬间好像早已发生过。\n\n\n\n女主： 你常来这个角落。\n\n男主： 因为这里的光线最好。而且…安静。\n\n旁白： 他从书页间抽出一张浅蓝色的便签，边缘有些卷曲。阳光正移过她的手背。\n\n男主： 这个…夹在我刚看完的书里。我想，或许该物归原主。\n\n\n\n女主： ……“寻找相同频率的波长”？真是…奇怪的读书笔记。\n\n男主： 可能不是笔记。是…提问。\n\n旁白： 便签在她指间停住。窗外的云移开了，光突然盈满整张桌子。她的睫毛在光里染成淡金色。\n\n女主： 那么……这是我的答案。\n\n\n\n男主： 明天……下午三点。\n\n旁白： 纸条上只有一行小字：「电波接收中，信号清晰。明天，同一频率。」", "1.7B", "auto", "bf16", "Auto", 1, true, 4, 5, 1, 2048, 4, 20, 1, 2048, 0.8, 20, 1, 1.05, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"name": "role_bank", "link": 14, "label": "role_bank", "type": "QWEN3_ROLE_BANK", "localized_name": "role_bank"}, {"widget": {"name": "script"}, "name": "script", "link": 38, "label": "script", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "script"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_choice"}, "name": "model_choice", "label": "model_choice", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_choice"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "precision"}, "name": "precision", "label": "precision", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "precision"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "pause_linebreak"}, "name": "pause_linebreak", "link": 29, "label": "pause_linebreak", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "pause_linebreak"}, {"widget": {"name": "period_pause"}, "name": "period_pause", "link": 30, "label": "period_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "period_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "comma_pause"}, "name": "comma_pause", "link": 31, "label": "comma_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "comma_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "question_pause"}, "name": "question_pause", "link": 32, "label": "question_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "question_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "hyphen_pause"}, "name": "hyphen_pause", "link": 33, "label": "hyphen_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "hyphen_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "merge_outputs"}, "name": "merge_outputs", "label": "me